@scene awakening

background: night_forest.avif
music: awakening.mp3

dialogue:
"Cold wind. Wet grass under your hands. You open your eyes."
"Above you, through black branches, hang stars in shapes you do not recognise."

background: night_valley.avif

dialogue:
"You sit up. A valley you have never seen, and a crescent moon the wrong shape above it."
"You don't remember how you got here. You don't remember anything before this moment."

background: ruins.png

dialogue:
"Behind you, half-swallowed by the hillside, ancient ruins are still faintly glowing."
"Suddenly—"

system arrival:
"ISEKAI ARRIVAL"
"You have been summoned to another world."

system alarm:
"SYSTEM INITIALIZING"
"Welcome, Unknown Traveler."
"Identity required."

npc System:
"Before you can be, you must be WRITTEN. This is how this world stores a thing."

system skill_learned:
"THE FIRST SYNTAX"
"name = value"
"A name on the left, an equals sign, and the value it is to hold on the right."

npc System:
"Text is wrapped in quotation marks — single or double, so long as they match. player_name = 'Aston'."
"Numbers are written bare, with no quotes at all. hp = 100."
"Nothing else is required of you yet. A name, an equals, a value — eight times over."

npc System:
"Please initialize your character."

mission:
variables_intro

reward:
xp: 25
title: Awakened One

next:
chapter_1_dragon
